<article class="prose wrap">
  {% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}
  <p class="eyebrow">Truck rental and moving labor</p>
  <h1>List your business</h1>
  <p>If you rent moving trucks or cargo vans, or you provide labor-only loading and unloading, and those facts are published on your website or a public location page, we want the record to be accurate — especially hours, one-way vs. in-town rentals, and whether you will load a truck the customer already has.</p>
  <p>Send:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Business name and the city or neighborhood</li>
    <li>Street address, phone, and website</li>
    <li>Hours for each day, including Saturday and Sunday if you publish them</li>
    <li>What you offer (for example cargo vans, box trucks, one-way rentals, or labor-only loading of a customer’s truck or container)</li>
    <li>A public page where we can verify those facts</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We will not publish hours or services we cannot check on a public source, and we may recrawl your page before each update. We will not list live truck counts as inventory.</p>
  <p>
    <a class="button" href="mailto:{{ site.emailListings }}?subject=List%20a%20moving%20business">Email {{ site.emailListings }}</a>
  </p>
</article>
